OL,3,GNEWSAElectric bike seizures soar as
OL,4,Apolice warn of growing problem
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe number of electric motorbikes,
OL,7,Fe-bikes and e-scooters seized by police
OL,8,Fin Scotland has nearly doubled over the
OL,9,Fpast year.
OL,11,FOfficers seized 1,204 illegal vehicles
OL,12,Fbetween January and October, according
OL,13,Fto police operational records, up from
OL,14,F727 in the same period in 2025.
OL,16,FThe figures were contained in a report
OL,17,Fsubmitted to Holyrood's justice
OL,18,Fcommittee which is taking evidence as
OL,19,Fpart of an inquiry into crime and
OL,20,Fantisocial behaviour involving electric
OL,21,Fbikes and scooters.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
