OL,3,GNEWSAElectric bike seizures soar as
OL,4,Apolice warn of growing problem
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe force says that since September it
OL,7,Fhas had a policy of destroying seized
OL,8,Fvehicles, whereas previously they were
OL,9,Fsometimes auctioned and could end up
OL,10,Fback on the streets.
